    {
      "id": 960000000008,
      "plugin": "Cardinal",
      "model": "TextEditor",
      "version": "2.0",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / RHYTHMIC GRIT BASS\n\nPlay short lower MIDI notes or DAW-sequenced\nrhythms for punchy filtered bass.\n\nMorphVCO OCTAVE -2 -> StateFilter LP -> VCA\nMIDI GATE -> short ADSR controls loudness.\n\nMACROS: Growl, Resonance, Drive, Cutoff.\nCutoff uses bipolar -5V to +5V Macro4.\nSnapshot A is muted/subby; B is brighter,\nraspier and more resonant; LIVE resets\nmacro control to the current knobs.\n\nNo internal sequencer: rhythm comes from MIDI.\nOutput gain reduced; monitor safely.\n",
        "width": 29
      },
      "pos": [
        78,
        0
      ]
    }
